%N A373280 Expansion of Sum_{k>=0} x^(4^k) / (1 - 4*x^(4^k)).
%H A373280 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A373280/b373280.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..1000</a>
%F A373280 G.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = x/(1 - 4*x) + A(x^4).
%F A373280 If n == 0 (mod 4), a(n) = 4^(n-1) + a(n/4) otherwise a(n) = 4^(n-1). [Corrected by _Seiichi Manyama_, Aug 11 2026]
%o A373280 (PARI) a_vector(n) = my(v=vector(n)); for(i=1, n, v[i]=4^(i-1)+if(i%4==0, v[i/4])); v; \\ _Seiichi Manyama_, Aug 11 2026
